    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="186" width="420" height="240">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.55">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(76,122,90,1)">A 基线</span>：本地管线 AUROC≈0.985，TPR@1% FPR≈89.2%</p>
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(76,122,90,1)">B 浅层变换</span>：节点替换、边反转、序列重排——弱修改被 parser 规范化抹平</p>
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(76,122,90,1)">C 强算子</span>：修饰/论元子图交换——低分率提升但质量通过仅 46%</p>
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(76,122,90,1)">D 重入拓扑</span>：共享节点拆分与重绑定——低分率 26.7%、质量约 50%</p>
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(76,122,90,1)">E 反馈搜索</span>：每段 4 候选，低分覆盖 249/250——但混入质量失败；E4 句界臂原始逃逸 93.3%</p>
      </content>
